  "content": "\n\n<h1>DarkHeads</h1>\n<p><strong>描述</strong></p>\n<p>收集玩家死亡後掉落的玩家頭像。</p>\n<p><em>支援伺服器端。您只需安裝在伺服器上，客戶端無需安裝。</em></p>\n<p>由製作 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 的相同作者開發（若要獲得完整 RPG 體驗，請取得 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 整合包</a>，暢享任務與角色扮演玩法）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>（這些功能特色將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗）&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組會在單人與多人模式中，每次該玩家死亡時掉落一顆玩家頭像。您隨後可將其拾起進行收集。無論是遭到生物、世界事件或其他玩家擊殺皆會觸發。<br>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/669/807/player-heads.png\" width=\"1203\" height=\"599\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就購買伺服器，和好友一起遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅 &amp; 使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
